  "objective": "# External idea (operator-selected)\n\n**Mode:** pure Cursor Ultra-lite (model/auto per Cursor mode; no Codex / hybrid)\n**App name intent:** DocBrief AI\n**Positioning:** paid AI document / whiteboard / receipt briefing coach — NOT a dumb scanner\n**Reference:** TurboScan Pro / com.novosoft.TurboScan — category reference only; do NOT copy brand, UI, assets, or unauthorized scraping\n\n## Idea\nBuild a paid AI document briefer (not another dumb scanner): import doc/whiteboard/receipt photos, recognize type and key fields, chat to extract actions and deadlines, generate visual summary cards, TTS spoken briefing—unlock unlimited briefs.\n\n## Pricing intent\nPaid unlock for unlimited briefs (one-time or equivalent unlock path). Core free path may allow a limited demo brief if needed for App Store clarity; paid unlocks unlimited briefs + full coach features.\n\n## Constraints\n- Privacy local-first; minimize cloud retention of user photos/docs\n- Do not copy TurboScan brand/UI\n- Core sell-path must be runtime-tested; simulator-impossible items mark as 真机待测 (does not block delivery)\n- Only core defects block delivery; non-core → known_issues; max 2 repair rounds\n- Prefer product delivery push to git@github.com:xy-gty/xy-gty.git\n- Feishu registration / delivery card deferred (operator instruction)\n- No hand-editing MAP / receipts\n- App name, UI, store copy must avoid owner-forbidden languages when specified\n\n## Slot / worktree\nfactory-prod-2 · slot B · stagger simulator lease vs factory-prod-1\n",
